Since 2019, Apple has released a more affordable standard iPhone and a higher-end "Pro" variant, giving customers multiple flagship iPhones to choose from. Apple is deviating from its standard release timeline this year and splitting the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18/">iPhone 18</a> launch.<br/>
<br/>
