<h2 id="whats_next">What's Next?</h2><br/>
After launching the &zwnj;iPhone 18&zwnj;, iPhone 18e, and &zwnj;iPhone Air&zwnj; 2 in spring 2027, it's not clear if Apple will stick with the spring/fall split launch strategy or revert to its standard timing.<br/>
